 "final_message": "Sam and Nadia's Brightpath application (BHL-26001) is now in underwriting. Both conditions have been answered, and the lender hasn't posted any further requests.\n\n- **Loan Estimate:** It is within all three limits, so I recorded your intent to proceed.\n  - Rate: 7.25% (limit 7.5%).\n  - Monthly payment: $3,485.58 (limit $3,600).\n  - Closing costs: $13,200 (limit $14,500).\n  - Cash to close is $123,200, and the rate lock is 45 days.\n- **Documents:** I sent 12 records. They were the last 2 statements for each of the four personal accounts and the last 2 payslips for each of you. I didn't send anything from the business account.\n- **Condition 1, the $8,000 deposit:** Sam told me it was a gift from their parents toward the down payment and isn't a loan. I sent that as the written explanation.\n- **Condition 2, W-2s:** I attached both 2025 W-2s, which the lender had requested.\n\nThe application was submitted only once. The next step is the lender's underwriting decision.",
